  "title": "Remove Duplicate Letters",
  "summary": "Given a string s, eliminate repeated characters to ensure each character appears exactly once, with the result being the lexicographically smallest among all feasible outcomes.",
  "statement": "Given a string s, eliminate repeated characters to ensure each character appears exactly once, with the result being the lexicographically smallest among all feasible outcomes.",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= len(s) <= 10000; s contains lowercase English letters.",
    "Delete characters without rearranging the survivors. Include every distinct letter exactly once, and choose the lexicographically smallest valid subsequence."
  ],
